 for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Engineered to push the limits of what a high-performance SUV can achieve, the Urus Performante combines breathtaking power, motorsport-inspired engineering, and unmistakable Lamborghini design into one extraordinary package. Powered by a twin-turbocharged 4.0L V8 producing 657 horsepower and 627 lb-ft of torque, the Performante accelerates from 0&ndash;60 mph in approximately 3.3 seconds while sending power through an 8-speed automatic transmission and all-wheel drive. Its performance-focused chassis sits nearly an inch lower than the standard Urus and replaces the air suspension with steel springs, while extensive carbon fiber components, a wider stance, sharpen its handling and road presence. Inside, the cabin blends premium Alcantara, carbon fiber trim, sport-focused details, and advanced Lamborghini technology, creating an environment that is equally suited to everyday luxury and spirited driving. With its extraordinary ability to deliver sports-car acceleration and remarkable cornering capability from behind the wheel of an SUV, the Urus Performante proves that practicality and performance do not have to be mutually exclusive. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports \\\/ Lamborghini Miami to make this Urus Performante yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":19,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-lamborghini-urus-performante-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65810522\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2024-Lamborghini-Urus-Performante