ent, memory settings, and premium leather upholstery. The cabin features Alcantara headliner, aluminum and piano black accents, and a comprehensive Lamborghini Infotainment System with navigation, smartphone integration, Wi-Fi hotspot, and an 8-speaker audio system. Dual-zone climate control, head-up display, and soft-close doors elevate every journey.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #86230X \\\/ VIN: ZPBUB3ZLXRLA30573**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Experience automotive excellence. Contact Prestige Imports today to schedule your exclusive test drive of this remarkable Lamborghini Urus S. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":19,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-lamborghini-urus-s-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66170890\",\"mainImageUrl\":null,\"photoCount\":0,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Adaptive Cruise Control,Backup Camera,Blind Spot Monitor,Brake Assist,Head-Up Display,Heated Seats,Hybrid,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Lane Departure Warning,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Memory Seat,Navigation System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,Turbocharged\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\