WB for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Combining timeless Range Rover luxury with modern technology and effortless performance, this P400 SE delivers an exceptional balance of refinement, capability, and everyday usability. Powered by a turbocharged 3.0L inline-six with mild-hybrid assistance producing 395 horsepower and 406 lb-ft of torque, the Range Rover sends power through an 8-speed automatic transmission and all-wheel-drive system, with a manufacturer-estimated 0&ndash;60 mph time of approximately 5.5 seconds. The SWB configuration provides a more agile footprint while maintaining the commanding presence and spacious luxury that have made the Range Rover an icon. Its elegant exterior design, signature LED lighting, flush door handles, and refined proportions create a sophisticated presence whether cruising through the city, arriving at a five-star destination, or heading toward a weekend getaway. Inside, the cabin surrounds occupants with premium materials, advanced technology, exceptional craftsmanship, and a serene atmosphere designed to make every journey feel effortless. With sophisticated four-wheel-drive technology, adjustable air suspension, and impressive towing capability, the Range Rover remains equally comfortable navigating urban streets or venturing far beyond them. For those seeking a luxury SUV that combines commanding presence, sophisticated design, genuine capability, and effortless performance, the 2024 Range Rover P400 SE SWB is an exceptional choice. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Land Rover Range Rover yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":24,\"epaCity\":18,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami