ed with luxurious **Tan Nappa Leather** interior. With only 1,643 miles on the odometer, this is your opportunity to own a virtually new example of Lotus's most refined sports car to date.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock:** ATB44212 \\\/ **VIN:** SCCLEKMX7RHB44212<br\\\/><br\\\/>This Emira represents the perfect balance of raw performance and modern convenience. At its heart lies a **2.0L turbocharged 4-cylinder engine** mated to an **8-speed dual-clutch automatic transmission** with driver-selectable modes and steering wheel-mounted sequential shifters. The rear-wheel-drive configuration, combined with Bilstein shock absorbers, Eibach coil springs, and sport-tuned double wishbone suspension, delivers the pure driving dynamics Lotus is legendary for.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Premium Features Include:**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The cabin showcases **12-way power-adjustable heated front seats** with memory settings and 4-way lumbar support, wrapped in premium Nappa leather with Alcantara accents throughout. Stay connected with **Apple CarPlay and Android Auto** integration through the 10.25\\\"\\\" touchscreen, while the **KEF Premium 10-channel audio system** (560 watts, 10 speakers) delivers concert-quality sound.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Performance & Safety:**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Riding on stunning **20\\\"\\\" ultra-lightweight forged V-spoke wheels** with Goodyear Eagle F1 Supersport tires (245\\\/35R20 front, 295\\\/30R20 rear), this Emira stops confidently with 4-wheel vented disc brakes and brake assist. Advanced features include front\\\/rear parking sensors, backup camera, electronic stability control, and hill hold control.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Clean History Guaranteed:**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Both **CARFAX and AUTOCHECK Clean** reports confirm this one-owner Emira has been meticulously maintained and is accident-free.<br\\\/><br\\\/>Don't miss this rare opportunity to own Lotus's most accessible supercar. Contact Prestige Imports today to schedule your exclusive test drive! Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":null,\"epaCity\":null,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-lotus-emira-first-edition-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66182681\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2024-Lotus-Emira-First-Edition-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-SCCLEKMX7RHB44212\\\/sz_1\\\/3a69a38e4a93f992311806ba99ac9ef7.jpg\",\"photoCount\":45,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Heated Seats,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Lane Departure Warning,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Memory Seat,Navigation System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,Turbocharged,USB Port\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own_great.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/4jN-_ul1GDTT8crt3rnGDVtDrUsGLEGtFzcyg53Ea37E3enGWEr_m6GKM6iQ0VFaixPv9GlYFGgvc1kDQa4iYJDx7ijBB_sXY_8\",\"isOneOwner\":true},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Green\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"Rear-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"2.0\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"4 Cylinder\",\"standardizedTransmission\":\"Automatic\",\"sta