 front seat upholstery\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Vivid Red\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"E32F43\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"101.4\",\"vehicleId\":145465515,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":259,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-01-14 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"\\\"Prestige Imports \\\/ Lotus Miami  is delighted to offer this 2026 Lotus Emira V6 SE for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Representing the purest expression of Lotus's \\\"\\\"For The Drivers\\\"\\\" philosophy, the Emira V6 SE combines mid-engine balance, communicative steering, and a thrilling supercharged V6 to create an exceptionally engaging modern sports car. Powered by a supercharged 3.5L V6 producing 400 horsepower and 310 lb-ft of torque, the Emira V6 SE sends power to the rear wheels through a six-speed manual transmission with a limited-slip differential, delivering a deeply rewarding connection between driver and machine. Its sculpted bodywork, low-slung stance, extended Black Pack, 20-inch forged alloy wheels, and striking red brake calipers give the Emira an unmistakable presence whether carving through winding roads, arriving at an exclusive automotive gathering, or enjoying a weekend drive. The V6 SE also benefits from refined damper calibration, optimized wheel alignment, and revised manual gearbox mounting, enhancing both ride comfort and the precision of every shift. Inside, the driver-focused cabin features Alcantara appointments, sport pedals, premium technology, and an intimate two-seat layout that keeps the emphasis exactly where it belongs, behind the wheel. With its hydraulic steering, rear-wheel drive, naturally balanced mid-engine chassis, and manual transmission, the Emira V6 SE offers the kind of analog driving experience that is increasingly rare in the modern sports-car world. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Conta